{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1152224-using-lillith-in-game","id":1152224,"title":"Using Lillith in game","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-10-23T10:20:51-07:00","id":1152224,"title":"Using Lillith in game","content":"I'm curious to know if and how you personally used Lillith in your chronicle, and how it was received by your players.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13564-trategos_sol","name":"Trategos_Sol","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13564_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"89"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-23T14:56:01-07:00","id":1152304,"title":"","content":"I'm currently using her as a plot point, but it's not resolved yet. She hasn't even shown up in person and since a player of mine is reading this forum, I won't tell anything, yet.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13221-thevarulfen","name":"TheVarulfen","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"179"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-25T11:26:09-07:00","id":1152850,"title":"","content":"I would not use her ever, and Caine neither.<br /> Not in a Vampire chronicle anyway, having them as Umbral emanations in Mage or Werewolf is fine.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13673-maris-streck","name":"Maris Streck","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13673_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-25T12:12:02-07:00","id":1152865,"title":"","content":"Never. Ever. Using Methuselahs is bad enough imo. Takes away too much of the mystery.<br /> <br /> That said, I really love Bahari cults, both as npcs and as a player. A Setite Bahari heresy can be neat to play with.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4234-bodhiofur","name":"BodhiofUr","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"67"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-30T10:26:12-07:00","id":1154159,"title":"","content":"In one past Mage The Ascension chronicle Lilith features heavily as a background character, though she was never indentified as such. The guise she wore through most of the campaign was that of the Lady of the Lake, an excentric Archmage who had sired a brood of dragons and lived in an umbral chantry called Avalon. Yes Arthur was sleeping over there. She mostly seemed to manipulate events for her own amusement, but underlying there was a method to her madness, eventually tasking the npcs with recovering a potent artifact for her. In that game Lilith was the daughter of Eve and Lucifer and saw Ascension as the creation of a new god, which she abhored and strived to prevent that ever happening, though that aswell never got openly stated. She was received as a fun character by most, somewhat horrifying in the ease with which she did complicated magical workings and the disregard for morals or casualties with which she acted sometimes. (Once she offered a magical sowrd to one of the player characters which destroyed everything it cut so utterly that it terrified the PC so badly he gave it back willingly, not trusting himself with handling it. Annoyed she threw it out into the street for a random sleeper to pick up.)<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1131211-flintys-homebrew-hub-2e\" target=\"_blank\">My Mage 2e Homebrew</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5241-flinty","name":"Flinty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"793"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}